foundation.question_text:
The network diagram represents streets for travel between Home ($A$) and School ($D$), with numbers indicating travel times in minutes.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,2.4);
\coordinate (B) at (2.4,3.2);
\coordinate (C) at (2.4,1.2);
\coordinate (D) at (4.8,1.2);
\coordinate (E) at (2.4,-0.4);
\coordinate (F) at (0,0.4);
\draw (A) -- (B) node[midway, above left] {$3$};
\draw (B) -- (C) node[midway, right] {$4$};
\draw (A) -- (C) node[midway, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$5$};
\draw (C) -- (D) node[midway, above] {$7$};
\draw (A) -- (F) node[midway, left] {$4$};
\draw (F) -- (E) node[midway, below] {$3$};
\draw (E) -- (C) node[midway, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$2$};
\draw (E) -- (D) node[midway, below right] {$6$};
\fill (A) circle (2.5pt) node[left] {$A$};
\fill (B) circle (2.5pt) node[above] {$B$};
\fill (C) circle (2.5pt) node[above left] {$C$};
\fill (D) circle (2.5pt) node[right] {$D$};
\fill (E) circle (2.5pt) node[below] {$E$};
\fill (F) circle (2.5pt) node[below left] {$F$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Calculate the travel time in minutes along the path $A\text{–}F\text{–}E\text{–}D$.

foundation.solution_text:
1. **Trace the sequence of vertices along valid edges**
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,2.4);
\coordinate (B) at (2.4,3.2);
\coordinate (C) at (2.4,1.2);
\coordinate (D) at (4.8,1.2);
\coordinate (E) at (2.4,-0.4);
\coordinate (F) at (0,0.4);
\draw (A) -- (B) node[midway, above left] {$3$};
\draw (B) -- (C) node[midway, right] {$4$};
\draw (A) -- (C) node[midway, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$5$};
\draw (C) -- (D) node[midway, above] {$7$};
\draw[line width=1.6pt] (A) -- (F) node[midway, left] {$4$};
\draw[line width=1.6pt] (F) -- (E) node[midway, below] {$3$};
\draw (E) -- (C) node[midway, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$2$};
\draw[line width=1.6pt] (E) -- (D) node[midway, below right] {$6$};
\fill (A) circle (2.5pt) node[left] {$A$};
\fill (B) circle (2.5pt) node[above] {$B$};
\fill (C) circle (2.5pt) node[above left] {$C$};
\fill (D) circle (2.5pt) node[right] {$D$};
\fill (E) circle (2.5pt) node[below] {$E$};
\fill (F) circle (2.5pt) node[below left] {$F$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
2. **Sum the weights of the traversed edges**
$\text{Travel time} = 4 + 3 + 6$
$= 13\text{ minutes}$

